From: Ritesh Pandit <87899750+Riteshp2001@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 05:41:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 048/140] fix(ui): stabilize tab navigation and return through
 Home

Consolidate the three navigation fixes: native main-tab swipe ownership, fixed-slot animated navigation dock, foreground-gated interactions, Home-first Back handling, consistent screen transitions, and off-main-thread music processing. Retain the layout import required for dock positioning.

Remove the Python regression script introduced in this series as requested. Static guards passed before removal; no local Android build or compilation run.
